hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"602","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Janwar ka zakhm zae [hadar] hai; khadan zae hai; kunwan zae hai [agar baghair qasd ke kisi ko gira de].'"
"603","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Janwar ka zakhm zae hai; khadan zae hai; kunwan zae hai.'"
"604","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Janwar [us ke zakhm ka] zae hai; kunwan zae hai; khadan zae hai.'"
"605","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fath [Makkah] ke din Ka'ba ki seedhi par khade hue, phir farmaya: 'Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jis ne Apna wada sach farmaya, Apne bande ki madad farmai, aur lashkaron ko akele shikast di. Khabardar, beshak aadhe qasd [shibhul-amd] ghalti se qatl kode ya dande se, us mein sau oont hain sakht [mughallaza]: Un mein se chalis gabhin oontniyan jin ke peton mein un ke bachche hain. Khabardar, beshak har fakhr, khoon aur maal jo Jahiliyat mein tha, woh mere in dono qadmon ke neeche hai [mita diya gaya]; siwae hajiyon ko pani pilane aur Ka'ba ki chaabi rakhne ke; beshak main in dono ko un ke walon ke liye jari rakhta hun jaise the.'"
"606","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'id bin Zaid bin Amr bin Nufail (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: 'Aur jo apne maal ki hifazat mein qatl kiya jae woh shaheed hai; jo ek balisht zameen zulm se le, use saat zameenon ka tauq pehnaya jae.'"
